@startuml C4-Container

title Multi-Agent Game Strategy - Container Diagram

actor Player

rectangle "Multi-Agent Game Strategy System" {

    rectangle "Game Input Module" as Input
    rectangle "Coordinator Agent" as Coordinator
    rectangle "Strategy Agent" as Strategy
    rectangle "Action Agents" as Action
    rectangle "Game Engine" as Engine
}

Player --> Input : Provides game objective\nand game state
Input --> Coordinator : Sends game information
Coordinator --> Strategy : Requests strategy
Strategy --> Coordinator : Returns strategy
Coordinator --> Action : Assigns actions
Action --> Engine : Executes game action
Engine --> Coordinator : Returns updated game state
Coordinator --> Player : Returns recommended action

@enduml